  "executive_briefing": "As of mid-2026, the cryptocurrency market is entering a phase of structural institutionalization, anchored by the legislative momentum of the Digital Asset Market Clarity Act (CLARITY Act). The shift is characterized by a move away from speculative volatility toward regulated financial infrastructure, where Bitcoin ETFs are now standard treasury assets and Ethereum remains the dominant DeFi execution layer. A critical technical bifurcation is emerging: while the EVM continues to lead in application flexibility, institutional demand is pivoting toward decidable, formally verifiable smart contract languages like Clarity on Bitcoin-native layers to mitigate logic-based risks. Furthermore, the ecosystem is aggressively moving to resolve liquidity fragmentation, with native atomic swaps and solver-based intent models replacing vulnerable, bridge-heavy cross-chain architectures.",
